      "writtenOn": "2026-10-25T09:14:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`e.getMessage()` is returned verbatim as a 409. For an invalid winning file in an ancestor that is not visible to the caller, this discloses the ancestor\u0027s project name, file path, and bounded parser-diagnostic details such as a private header field name or a JSON path (via `ActionResolver` and `ActionFileParser.shown()`).\n\nField values and prompt bodies are not echoed, but the private ancestor identity and header structure are. Return a generic error to unauthorized readers and keep the detail in the server log.",
